"label": "deezer", "url": "https://www.deezer.com/search/Grupo+Niche+Una+Aventura", "search": true}, {"label": "discogs", "url": "https://www.discogs.com/search/?q=Grupo+Niche+Una+Aventura&type=all", "search": true}], "notes": ["1990 Sony Music Latin"]}], "counts": {"high": 5, "mid": 8, "low": 10}, "transcripts": [{"start": "00:00:31", "end": "00:01:41", "text": "This is Vanessa Andres and this is the show we platform Latinx Music, Arts and Culture from Southport Australia and from around the world. Before we begin, I want to acknowledge that we're broadcasting from the unceded lands of the Gadigal people of the Eora Nation. I want to extend my respect to elders past, present and emerging and acknowledge that this is a place where music, arts and culture has been. been shared practiced for thousands of years and i also want to acknowledge that the latinx indigenous experience is intertwined with that of aboriginal and terrestrial island people so acknowledge that today and every day if you're just tuning in uh we are preparing to have the next hour together i've got a bunch of new music i've got some old music all latinx and i also have a mix from nati aka natalie caro multi-general dj comedian actor and writer so don't get anywhere we're gonna jump into mon la ferte"}, {"start": "00:13:24", "end": "00:14:14", "text": "This is Mi Gente, My People here on FBi Radio with me, Vanessa Andres, and you just heard, out of Ecuador, Sudameri's Janes with Memanera de Vivir, before that, Raiza Real with Bandidona, Bebe Linda, that's some Brazilian fun call, we had Luna Le, Yo Soy Fabulosa, and at the top of that chunk of music was Mon Laferte with Te Juro Que Volveré, and now we're going to get into a mix by the one the only nati otherwise known as natali caro you may have heard nati on fbi on kings and queens in the mornings but today they're coming to give us a taste of their latinx night at abercrombie it's called paleta so let's see"}, {"start": "00:52:33", "end": "00:53:24", "text": "That was Nati for Mi Gente and My People here on FBi Radio with me, Vanessa Andres. This is the show where we platform music, arts and culture from the Latinx community here in SoCort Australia and from the diaspora. So if you like what you heard, you can follow Nati over on Instagram or the club night paleta.latinx. I'm going to put all those details up on the FBi website for you at fbi.radio. if you hadn't heard of paleta before it's a free latinx party for queers the curious and their allies got a few more tracks to share with you before i hand you over to loose joints so do not go anywhere we're going to go to el sonocombo the herminio with niña fresa this one just throwing it back a little Thank you."}], "fbi_json": [{"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:00:33"}, "track": {"title": "Nohemí", "artists": [{"name": "Andrés Landero"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:01:35"}, "track": {"title": "Te juro que volveré", "artists": [{"name": "Mon Laferte"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "high"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:05:05"}, "track": {"title": "YO SOY FABULOSA", "artists": [{"name": "Lunalé"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "high"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:06:46"}, "track": {"title": "BANDIDONA BB LINDA", "artists": [{"name": "Raíssa Real & Chris Beats Zn"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "high"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:08:58"}, "track": {"title": "Mi Manera de Vivir", "artists": [{"name": "Sudamery Jane's"}, {"name": "Skinny Buay & Big Fly"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "high"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:14:02"}, "track": {"title": "Icónica", "artists": [{"name": "MJ Nebreda"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:16:12"}, "track": {"title": "Lady (Hear Me Tonight)", "artists": [{"name": "Modjo